{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01954","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 关山别荡子 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 关山别荡子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"那堪闻荡子，迢遰涉关山。\n肠爲马嘶断，衣从泪滴斑。\n愁看塞上路，讵惜镜中颜。\n傥见征西鴈，应传一字还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}